what it's really all about.

03:02:58.370 --> 03:03:01.050
And if you look at
situation smart,

03:03:01.050 --> 03:03:03.910
there are a lot of ways to apply
logic and think very carefully,

03:03:03.910 --> 03:03:07.390
but wisdom is probably what
you're really talking about.

03:03:07.390 --> 03:03:09.970
And again, I think Einstein
was right when he said,

03:03:09.970 --> 03:03:13.300
wisdom is knowing
what's important.

03:03:13.300 --> 03:03:16.840
So we try to get students
involved in bumping

03:03:16.840 --> 03:03:18.470
