one of these things

03:03:55.510 --> 03:03:58.480
that we all know very well.

03:03:58.480 --> 03:04:01.600
The data-- we have
lots of data, so it's

03:04:01.600 --> 03:04:05.950
statistically significant data.

03:04:05.950 --> 03:04:10.180
